idth=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2208\" d=\"M84 250Q84 372 166 450T360 539Q361 539 377 539T419 540T469 540H568Q583 532 583 520Q583 511 570 501L466 500Q355 499 329 494Q280 482 242 458T183 409T147 354T129 306T124 272V270H568Q583 262 583 250T568 230H124V228Q124 207 134 177T167 112T231 48T328 7Q355 1 466 0H570Q583 -10 583 -20Q583 -32 568 -40H471Q464 -40 446 -40T417 -41Q262 -41 172 45Q84 127 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJSZ2-222B\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1111,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"2869\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"1184\" y=\"676\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-780)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"722\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1723,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"809\" y=\"408\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-64\" x=\"4387\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"4944\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"5794\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6850,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-61\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-72\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-74\" x=\"893\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-61\" x=\"1282\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-6E\" x=\"1783\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-68\" x=\"2339\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\"></g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(3062,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"10708\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"11708\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"12469\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(14914,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(850,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2208\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(1795,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-28\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(2185,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2212\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(2963,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(3464,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2C\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(3909,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(4409,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-29\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"19713\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>But we have just seen that</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"58.055ex\" height=\"5.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 24995.9 2443.8\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n\\int \\dfrac{1}{1-x^2} \\,\\textrm{d}x = {\\color{red}\\arcoth{x}} + C, \\qquad {\\color{red}x\\in(-\\infty,-1) \\cup (1,\\infty)}.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJSZ2-222B\" d=\"M114 -798Q132 -824 165 -824H167Q195 -824 223 -764T275 -600T320 -391T362 -164Q365 -143 367 -133Q439 292 523 655T645 1127Q651 1145 655 1157T672 1201T699 1257T733 1306T777 1346T828 1360Q884 1360 912 1325T944 1245Q944 1220 932 1205T909 1186T887 1183Q866 1183 849 1198T832 1239Q832 1287 885 1296L882 1300Q879 1303 874 1307T866 1313Q851 1323 833 1323Q819 1323 807 1311T775 1255T736 1139T689 936T633 628Q574 293 510 -5T410 -437T355 -629Q278 -862 165 -862Q125 -862 92 -831T55 -746Q55 -711 74 -698T112 -685Q133 -685 150 -700T167 -741Q167 -789 114 -798Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2212\" d=\"M84 237T84 250T98 270H679Q694 262 694 250T679 230H98Q84 237 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-78\" d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314T481 292T458 288Q439 288 427 299T415 328Q415 374